<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="What happens to your text" id="Whathappenstoyourtext"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="bg" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="6" width="608" height="884" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. You type a prompt and press Enter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;“Add validation to CreateOrder…”: about 27 tokens.&lt;br&gt;This is the only part you wrote.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="30" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j1ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="47" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Copilot packs the context around it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;System instructions, your instructions, tool definitions,&lt;br&gt;earlier messages and the files you referenced.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="140" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j2ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="157" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. The tokenizer cuts everything into tokens&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Text becomes ID numbers the model can read: about 12,000.&lt;br&gt;Every one of them is billed as input.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="250" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j3ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="267" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. The cache reuses a repeated start, if it can&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;A prefix sent recently is read from cache&lt;br&gt;at about 10% of the input price.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="360" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j4ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="377" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. The model writes the answer, one token at a time&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Each output token is its own pass through the model,&lt;br&gt;which is why output costs about 5× input.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="470" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j5ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="487" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j6" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Every token is priced at the model’s rates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Fresh input + cached input + output, × price per 1M tokens.&lt;br&gt;100 AI Credits make one dollar.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="580" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j6ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="597" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j7" value="&lt;b&gt;7. The answer appears, and the usage is recorded&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;You see it in your editor. Your organization sees it&lt;br&gt;under AI usage in GitHub billing.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="690" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="j7ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="707" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="jsum" value="&lt;b&gt;One typical request: about 12,000 tokens in, 800 out&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;= 3.2 AI Credits on Claude Sonnet 5.5&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="800" width="560" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je0" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j1" target="j2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je1" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j2" target="j3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je2" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j3" target="j4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je3" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j4" target="j5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je4" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j5" target="j6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je5" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j6" target="j7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="je6" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="j7" target="jsum"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>